    Body.setAngularVelocity(wheel2, 0.2);
  }
});
```

This code will create a simple car with two wheels and a ball. You can steer the car using the 'A' and 'D' keys, or the arrow keys.

To develop a full Rocket League-style game, you would need to add advanced physics, more complex car controls, 3D rendering, a proper game loop, networking for multiplayer gameplay, scoring, and many more features. However, this basic setup should give you a starting point to build upon.

